Hi,
=20
In the end trial and error plus a bit of judicious re-ordering of =
devices plus f/w udates seems to have done the trick. I have the =
following in mcicap and so far the loader has been behaving fine. While =
the loader isn't actually an msl2024 that is just a title as far the the =
script goes so no worries.
=20
Cheers
=20
Joe
=20

mc2:\

       :mc=3D/dev/changer/mc7:

        :dn=3D/dev/tape/tape8c:tc=3Dmsl2024:

=20

# HP MSL2024 LTO3 Ultrium loader

msl2024|HP MSL2024:\

        :it=3Dscsi2:dt=3Dtape:bc:vt:is:pa:pe:re:rs:sv:ls:ae:

 =20
=20

